        k: [['derrybrien', 'slieve aughty'], ['2003', 'galway', 'wind farm', 'october']],
        c: ['Give an Irish example of a bog burst.', 'Derrybrien · Co. Galway · 2003 · wind farm · Slieve Aughty Mountains'],
